hi Sean,
 The multinomial abundance model has not been incorporated into unmarked, although the N-mixture model (pcount) might be satisfactory for your purposes, just be cautious in how you interpret parameters related to E(N).  Its possible the Negative binomial mixture would provide a good fit to this type of data.
regards,
andy

